meta {
  name: Direction Update
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/directions/update/{{directionId}}
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:json {
  {
    "group": "women_and_kids",
    "week": [1, 3, 5],
    "title_oz": "Yoga (yangilangan)",
    "title_ru": "Йога (обновлено)",
    "title_uz": "Йога (янгиланган)",
    "title_en": "Yoga (updated)",
    "short_content_oz": "Yangi jadval: dushanba, chorshanba, juma.",
    "short_content_ru": "Новое расписание: понедельник, среда, пятница.",
    "short_content_uz": "Янги жадвал: душанба, чоршанба, жума.",
    "short_content_en": "New schedule: Monday, Wednesday, Friday.",
    "age_oz": "16+",
    "age_ru": "16+",
    "age_uz": "16+",
    "age_en": "16+",
    "sort_order": 1,
    "status": true
  }
}

docs {
  Qisman yangilash: create multipart, lekin UPDATE JSON.
  Faqat yuborilgan maydonlar o'zgaradi.

  `week` bu yerda **JSON massiv** — `[1, 3, 5]`. Create'dagi kabi vergulli
  satr emas. Qoidalar:

  | Yuborilgan | Natija |
  |---|---|
  | `"week": [1, 3, 5]` | kunlar almashtiriladi |
  | `"week": [4, 2, 2]` | `[2, 4]` — tartiblanadi, takrori olib tashlanadi |
  | `"week": []` | kunlar bo'shatiladi |
  | `week` yuborilmasa | tegilmaydi |
  | `"week": [8]` | `400` + tarjimali xato (faqat 0..7) |

  `group` ixtiyoriy, lekin yuborilsa women | kids | women_and_kids
  bo'lishi shart — boshqa qiymat 400 + tarjimali xato qaytaradi.

  Fayllar bu endpoint orqali o'zgarmaydi — buning uchun
  `Direction Media Upload` yoki `11-Media` papkasidagi so'rovlardan foydalaning.
  Yozuv topilmasa tarjimali 404 qaytadi.
}
